<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <span style=\"color:#2B2E2F\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">It would appear that you have run afoul of Onyx Path's Black Friday Sale. My best suggestion would be to remove the version with the discount you already were eligible for from your cart and take advantage of the sale, which is a slightly better discount. Sales are sometimes better than discounts it would seem, as the discount is off of the regular price.</span></span></span> </div> </div> </div>...Um, as far as I can tell, there is NO sale price for the Print on Demand UNLESS it's coupled with the PDF of that book, which I already own. I'd only hoped to let someone know, not just to (almost literally) save a buck...<br /> <br /> Anyway, I ordered the book at the $45.18 price 'coz I can't live without it, but I wanted someone to know that there's wonkiness afoot. I doubt it shall do any good, but there it is.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>B.I.G. Bird spreads the word: Anybody with a heart votes love<br /> <a href=\"https://absintheandthorns.obsidianportal.com/\" target=\"_blank\">https://absintheandthorns.obsidianportal.com/</a></i>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/409-phaolan","name":"Phaolan","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar409_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"478"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-12-08T10:12:28-08:00","id":1014352,"title":"","content":"The above rant notwithstanding, <b>Promethean: the Created Second Edition</b> PoD is GORGEOUS! I do miss the 'silvery' cover treatment of the original, sold-in-shoppes version, but it's 